msgstr "Η εξαργύρωση πόντων απαιτεί συνδεδεμένο πελάτη."

#: .\cart\views\cart.py:1052
msgid ""
"The applied discounts and gift cards cover the full total; no payment intent"
" is needed."
msgstr ""
