#: .\core\templates\admin\product\stock_history.html:16
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Daily stock movements over the last %(window_days)s days. Reservations and "
"releases hold units without changing physical stock."
msgstr ""
"Ημερήσιες κινήσεις αποθέματος τις τελευταίες %(window_days)s ημέρες. Οι "
