"produced it and, for merchant-curated links, the relation type. An empty "
"list means the store has nothing worth showing here — render nothing. Report"
" an impression event with impression_id once the strip is shown, and echo it"
" on click events."
msgstr ""
"Προϊόντα προς εμφάνιση δίπλα στο προϊόν ή στα προϊόντα αναφοράς σε μια "
