#: .\tenant\models.py:972
msgid "ACS Billing Code"
msgstr "Κωδικός Χρέωσης ACS"

#: .\tenant\models.py:977
msgid ""
"ACS billing code (e.g. 'ΑΚ12345678'). No platform fallback — empty disables "
