" κενό απενεργοποιεί την ACS."

#: .\tenant\models.py:982
msgid "ACS Station Origin"
msgstr "Σταθμός Προέλευσης ACS"

#: .\tenant\models.py:987
msgid ""
"ACS origin station code (up to 8 chars). No platform fallback — empty "
